<km-title nodeId="cac29bf0d9ad455d9010dfb1d232a5d0">说明：全局变量</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="557d775ea1ca4433b9aa6bb9801ea3e0" />
<h1 nodeId="ec34bbcb697f4a31844185aacd3cbc35">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="5f9fc31abaf6460d8666d48457b5eac3">生产者在自定义组件的逻辑编排时存在一些全局通用参数，需要使用的用户进行设定，这类信息可在自定义组件中设置成全局变量。使用者，在应用自定义组是会设定变量的具体值。</p>
<h1 nodeId="d055f05fb7734d689ce6952130790311">二、名词解释</h1>
<p nodeId="0e1c916219804326aee26f62de067e8e">无</p>
<p nodeId="9d3ef7a09c3442a28a61232ea631b6ea" />
<h1 nodeId="e39378123f6a4159b9a17ee665234055">三、操作详情</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="835243e9b8044f9397552777fce9e621">
<tr nodeId="a8ab9722ee4a43a1ba4c066557c6f380">
<th colwidth="[564]" nodeId="c522453eeff444c5a51acfd01bba58e0">
<p nodeId="5c6f1bbf60884beea2c8a43348fa9b77">配置说明</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[705]" nodeId="714f2374852546228ddf9194b82a7940">
<p nodeId="0b67c0960cfd49efae05a4e6201a8cb3">截图</p>
</th>
